+# Alba voice for Aiden
+
+The reference recording is [“Casual,” voice acted by Alba MacKenna and published by Kyutai](https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-voices/blob/88a3419/alba-mackenna/casual.wav). The [Kyutai voice card](https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-voices#alba-mackenna) identifies it as [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The recording bytes are unchanged. This app uses the recording as a reference for synthesizing Aiden's original replies.
+
+The original model files come from the [Sherpa-ONNX Pocket TTS INT8 archive dated January 26, 2026](https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/tts-models/sherpa-onnx-pocket-tts-int8-2026-01-26.tar.bz2), SHA-256 `2f3b88823cbbb9bf0b2477ec8ae7b3fec417b3a87b6bb5f256dba66f2ad967cb`. The archive's README identifies its packaged conversion for noncommercial use. The bundled `LICENSE` is the license included in that archive. The original [Pocket TTS project](https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts) is from Kyutai.
+
